# Mark the binary course-material formats explicitly, so git never applies
# line-ending normalization or attempts a textual diff on them.
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary

# A notebook is JSON: it merges badly, so suppress the merge driver. It is
# deliberately NOT marked `-diff`. A notebook is the one file type in this
# repository that has already carried a graded answer key past review, and
# `-diff` renders it as "Binary files differ" in both `git diff` and GitHub's
# PR view -- which would hide exactly the content a reviewer has to read.
*.ipynb -merge
